 "notes": [
  "Posted 17 July 2001, before Coruscant; the list has no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "Posted 'My Kind of Scum/The Camp says I can't flip this Card' (a joke about the back side) dested the Objective My Kind Of Scum / Fearless And Inventive.",
  "The strategy says to start Tatooine: Jabba's Palace as the Jabba's Palace site (or Jabba's Palace: Lower Passages against Profit), Imperial Arrest Order always, and usually Mobilization Points plus a third effect (There Is No Try & Oppressive Enforcement, You Cannot Hide Forever, Secret Plans or Something Special Planned For Them); no separate starting section is posted and all count toward the 60.",
  "Posted 'Epp Vader' dested Darth Vader With Lightsaber; 'Mara Jade' Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand; 'JP Audience Chamber' the Dark Jabba's Palace: Audience Chamber; 'Tatooine' the Premiere Dark Tatooine.",
  "Secret Plans and Fanfare were Effects in July 2001 (not Defensive Shields).",
  "The strategy discusses a Grabber (pulled with Fanfare / deployed with There Is No Try & Oppressive Enforcement), but no Grabber is in the posted list; kept as published.",
  "The description says the deck won tournaments before, during and after the Denver World Qualifier Weekend; no single event or finish is given, so it stays a general deck.",
  "Total is 60 as published."
